<title>SPAIN: Spain six-month bill yields seen steady at auction.</title>
<headline>Spain six-month bill yields seen steady at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish six-months T-bill yields should be unchanged from the previous sale at 6.581 percent in an auction on Wednesday, dealers predicted.</p>
<p>On the grey market, the bills were trading at around 6.57/59 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It is very likely we will see the same yields we had two weeks ago,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>At the previous auction on October 23, six-month bills were unchanged at 6.581 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
